== Description ==
A superior {{PetTooltip|Zombie}}, his autoclick is stronger, with 100% click profit, 30% crit chance for 1200% crit profit. Increases source profits based on idle bonus and pet level. Also increases shard pool efficiency depending on his level.

Gains [[Experience#Pet Experience|experience]] through his autoclicks, even when offline.

== Pet Abilities ==

Autoclicks once per second:
* <math>\text{Click Profit}\;=\;\text{Hero Click Profit}</math>
* <math>\text{Crit Chance} = 30\%</math>
* <math>\text{Crit Profit} = 1200\%</math>


Multiplies profits by:
<br><math>L \times 10 \times 30^{0.6875\log_{10}(I)} \times \left(P^{0.6} + 1\right) \times T^{2} + 1</math>


with

<math>T = \begin{cases}\text{Pet Time in Hours},&\text{ if Pet Time }\leq\text{ 14 days}\\
\left(336^2 + (\text{Pet Time in Hours} - 336)^{0.5}\right)^{0.5},&\text{ if Pet Time }>\text{ 14 days}\end{cases}</math>

''Note:'' <math>30^{0.6875\log_{10}(I)} \approx I^{1.0155}</math>


Multiplies shard pool efficiency by:
<br><math>\left(S^{0.2} + 1 \right) \times \left(P^{0.01} + 1 \right) \times L \times 0.05 + 1</math>


where:
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>I = 1 + \frac{\text{Idle Profit Bonus}\%}{100}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>
* <math>S = \text{Summoning Efficiency}</math>

== Experience Gain ==
Gains experience each time it autoclicks, and each second while [[Idle Mode]] is active:

<math>(0.5 + F) \times M</math>

where:
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>

